# =====================================================================
# THE COMMUNITY LIBRARY PANEL -- what books a Kehillah's Beit Midrash
# holds, shown alongside the vanilla domicile window. ADDED 2026-09-15
# at user request; REBUILT the same day as a DYNAMIC list ("I want
# dozens of books to be possible... additive instead of showing missing
# books too... subject in-line... a description for each book on
# hover"). Design and live-pass record: docs/spec/v13-domicile-library-
# panel.md. Registered in gui/scripted_widgets/kehillah_scripted_
# widgets.txt, the same additive hook as the map view.
#
# NOTE (2026-10-15): the panel and its tab are built into the forked
# gui/window_domicile.gui (kehillah_domicile_attached_library) and read the
# domicile owner from DomicileWindow, so every community's library works from
# its own domicile view. The old companion windows that used to live below
# (own, other-quarter, standalone roster window, open button, view-reset) and
# the roster library button were removed; only the shared body type remains.
#
# WHY A COMPANION PANEL AND NOT A TAB (original reasoning, now superseded): the domicile window is vanilla's
# gui/window_domicile.gui, and this mod does not fork vanilla .gui files
# (docs/spec/gui-spike-community-list.md). So this is a fourth top-level
# scripted widget that appears whenever the domicile view is open, and
# goes away with it.
#
# WHICH DOMICILE -- THE BUG THAT HID THE PANEL FOR TWO DAYS (fixed
# 2026-09-17, v13 spec section 9). The first three builds read
# DomicileWindow.GetDomicile for their datacontext, on the strength of
# window_domicile.gui:2 reading the same thing. It resolves to NOTHING
# from here: DomicileWindow is a datacontext TYPE the engine injects
# into the vanilla window's own widget tree (the DumpDataTypes console
# dump lists it as "Type", not "Global promote" -- the only window
# globals are AccessCouncilWindow / AccessCourtWindow /
# AccessMyRealmWindow). With both datacontexts null, every visibility
# test that looked at Character failed and the panel never appeared;
# where it did appear (live pass 2) the list read empty for the same
# reason. Confirmed live with debug text lines: GetPlayer resolved,
# DomicileWindow.GetDomicile.GetName rendered blank.
#
# So the panel decides the community for ITSELF:
#   - by default, the PLAYER's own community (GetPlayer) -- every
#     vanilla route into the domicile view (realm panel card, title
#     window card, HUD) opens the player's own quarter;
#   - when the map roster's quarter button opened ANOTHER community's
#     quarter (gui/kehillah_community_map_view.gui), that button first
#     records the community on the player (var:kehillah_lib_viewed_
#     community, via scripted_gui kehillah_lib_view_community) and sets
#     the GUI-side flag kehillah_lib_viewing_other, and the panel reads
#     the recorded community instead. The flag is cleared by the
#     OTHER window's _hide state -- i.e. when the domicile view closes
#     on a roster-chosen quarter -- so it does not go stale across
#     views. Only that window clears it: the own-quarter window also
#     hides the instant the roster sets the flag, and a clear there
#     would undo the click.
# The two cases are the same body type (types block below) hosted by
# TWO top-level windows, kehillah_domicile_library (own) and
# kehillah_domicile_library_other (roster-chosen), only ever one of
# them visible -- plus a THIRD, kehillah_domicile_library_standalone
# (2026-09-19), which the roster's per-row library button opens beside
# the roster with no domicile view at all, so any community's library
# is one click away from the map; it has its own close button. Not two instances in one window: a hidden vbox
# instance kept its full height in the parent vbox despite
# ignoreinvisible = yes (live, 2026-09-17 -- the visible body sat 200
# px down, under an invisible twin), and a separate window is the
# robust way to give each body its own datacontexts. Known limit: opening
# another community's quarter through a VANILLA route (its title
# window's domicile card) leaves the flag unset, so the panel shows
# the player's own library -- the header always names whose library it
# is, so this is visible rather than silently wrong.
#
# LIVES IN THE BEIT MIDRASH (live passes 3-4, 2026-09-15, at user
# request: "could we have a beit midrash building that contains the
# books?"). The building IS the library: a community with one shows its
# roster; a community without one shows a single line saying so
# (kehillah_has_beit_midrash_value, common/script_values/kehillah_
# library_values.txt). The line rather than hiding the whole panel is
# deliberate: the other window's _hide state is what clears the
# viewing-other flag, so it must show for every Kehillah quarter the
# roster can open or the flag could stick. Since 2026-09-17 every Kehillah starts with a Beit
# Midrash anyway, so the line is only ever seen on pre-seed saves.
#
# WHERE: initially the column left of the 1390 x 694 centred domicile
# window. At 1538 x 890 the two windows overlap heavily; the 2026-10-14
# live check found most of this panel hidden behind vanilla. The own and
# other-quarter panels now use the top layer and a draggable position
# near the upper-left corner, so the controls remain reachable at that
# size. The map-roster standalone panel is another direct route.
#
# THE LIST IS DYNAMIC. datamodel = the title's kehillah_library_works
# variable_list (Title.MakeScope.GetList -- confirmed live 2026-09-17
# with the player's title); each item is a Scope holding a flag, and
# Scope.GetFlagName gives the flag's name as a string (vanilla: chariot_
# race_widget_types.gui:105, Var('wager_team').GetFlagName). Every text
# and tooltip on the row is then Localize( Concatenate( 'prefix_',
# Scope.GetFlagName ) ) (vanilla: Localize( Concatenate(
# 'COA_DESIGNER_CATEGORY_', CString.GetString ) )). So ADDING A BOOK IS
# (2026-10-15) Genre, rank, year and corpus are no longer per-work GUI or
# prose: each work is a row in scripts/kehillah_library_catalog.json, which
# scripts/kehillah_library_catalog.py turns into script values read here by
# flag (kehillah_lib_genre_<flag> etc.). The shelf is collapsible genre boxes.
# ZERO GUI WORK: one flag in script plus its name, subject, hover, and
# long-detail localization --
#   kehillah_lib_name_<flag>, kehillah_lib_subject_<flag>,
#   kehillah_lib_tt_<flag>, kehillah_lib_detail_<flag>
# -- see localization/english/kehillah_library_panel_l_english.yml.
# Only what is HELD is listed (additive); nothing is said about works
# the community lacks. The rows sit in a scrollbox (vanilla's own
# blockoverride "scrollbox_content" idiom, window_domicile.gui:1170) so
# a long library scrolls instead of running under the HUD.
#
# MASTERED BY YOU: each held row is marked (green name, check, and a
# status line in its tooltip) when the PLAYER has mastered that work --
# asked of script per row through the per-work kehillah_lib_studied_
# work_<flag> scripted_guis' IsValid (2026-09-19; GUI has no "is this
# item in that other list" call of its own). A second dynamic list of
# the player's kehillah_mastered_works can be expanded below the roster,
# for works mastered elsewhere that this library does not hold.
#
# STRUCTURE: vbox inside window, hboxes and vboxes nested freely, and
# no vbox/hbox as a direct child of a (flow)container (live passes 3
# and 8 both crashed on it). The scrollbox's content vbox is the one
# vanilla itself puts there.
# =====================================================================

@lib_width = 500
@lib_name_width = 350
@lib_list_height = 380

types KehillahLibrary
{
	# The hover card for a work, drawn by flag from the catalog: a left-aligned
	# title, then one sentence built from genre, rank, composer (a hoverable
	# concept link) and year, then the short description. Used as a
	# tooltipwidget inside any list item whose Scope is the work flag.
	type kehillah_library_work_tooltip = widget {
		using = GeneralTooltipSetup
		alwaystransparent = no
		using = DefaultTooltipBackground

		vbox = {
			set_parent_size_to_minimum = yes
			margin = { 20 12 }
			spacing = 6
			text_single = {
				layoutpolicy_horizontal = expanding
				align = left|nobaseline
				text = "[Localize( Concatenate( 'kehillah_lib_name_', Scope.GetFlagName ) )]"
				default_format = "#T"
			}
			text_multi = {
				layoutpolicy_horizontal = expanding
				autoresize = yes
				max_width = 360
				align = left|nobaseline
				text = "[Select_CString( GreaterThan_CFixedPoint( GetPlayer.MakeScope.ScriptValue( Concatenate( 'kehillah_lib_author_ready_', Scope.GetFlagName ) ), '(CFixedPoint)0' ), Localize( Concatenate( 'kehillah_lib_blurb_', Scope.GetFlagName ) ), Localize( Concatenate( 'kehillah_lib_blurb_plain_', Scope.GetFlagName ) ) )]"
			}
			text_multi = {
				layoutpolicy_horizontal = expanding
				autoresize = yes
				max_width = 360
				align = left|nobaseline
				default_format = "#weak"
				text = "[Localize( Concatenate( 'kehillah_lib_desc_', Scope.GetFlagName ) )]"
			}
		}
	}

	# One shelf row: NAME | rank and genre | mastery on a single line. Passes
	# in the genre boxes override "row_visible" with a rank slot, which is how
	# the shelf comes out in rank order (Foundational first).
	# A plain container owns row visibility, so a hidden row collapses without
	# leaving a gap; the interactive list button remains its only child.
	type kehillah_library_work_row = container {
		block "row_visible" {}
		button_standard_list = {
			size = { 482 42 }
			onclick = "[GetVariableSystem.Clear( 'kehillah_lib_parent_corpus' )]"
			onclick = "[GetScriptedGui( 'kehillah_lib_cache_authors' ).Execute( GuiScope.SetRoot( GetPlayer.MakeScope ).End )]"
			onclick = "[GetVariableSystem.Set( 'kehillah_lib_selected_work', Scope.GetFlagName )]"
			onclick = "[GetScriptedGui( Concatenate( 'kehillah_lib_holders_', Scope.GetFlagName ) ).Execute( GuiScope.SetRoot( GetPlayer.MakeScope ).End )]"
			tooltipwidget = {
				kehillah_library_work_tooltip = {}
			}
			icon = {
				parentanchor = left|vcenter
				position = { 4 0 }
				size = { 36 36 }
				texture = "gfx/interface/icons/kehillah_library/kehillah_sefer_rank_frames.dds"
				framesize = { 64 64 }
				frame = "[FixedPointToInt( GetPlayer.MakeScope.ScriptValue( Concatenate( 'kehillah_lib_frame_', Scope.GetFlagName ) ) )]"
				alwaystransparent = yes
			}
			icon = {
				parentanchor = left|vcenter
				position = { 10 0 }
				size = { 24 24 }
				texture = "gfx/interface/icons/artifact/artifact_chronicle.dds"
				alwaystransparent = yes
			}
			### NAME | rank and genre | mastery, on one line.
			text_single = {
				parentanchor = left|vcenter
				position = { 50 0 }
				text = "[Localize( Concatenate( 'kehillah_lib_name_', Scope.GetFlagName ) )]"
				default_format = "#high"
				max_width = 215
			}
			text_single = {
				parentanchor = left|vcenter
				position = { 270 0 }
				text = "[Localize( Concatenate( 'KEHILLAH_STANDING_', IntToString( FixedPointToInt( GetPlayer.MakeScope.ScriptValue( Concatenate( 'kehillah_lib_standing_', Scope.GetFlagName ) ) ) ) ) )]"
				tooltip = "KEHILLAH_LIB_LADDER_TT"
				default_format = "#weak"
				max_width = 160
			}
			icon = {
				parentanchor = right|vcenter
				position = { -10 0 }
				size = { 25 25 }
				texture = "gfx/interface/icons/kehillah_library/kehillah_mastery_ring_1.dds"
				framesize = { 32 32 }
				frame = "[Select_int32( GetScriptedGui( Concatenate( 'kehillah_lib_studied_', Scope.GetFlagName ) ).IsValid( GuiScope.SetRoot( GetPlayer.MakeScope ).End ), '(int32)2', '(int32)1' )]"
				alwaystransparent = yes
			}
		}
	}

	# A missing, already-circulating work on the acquisition page. The list is
	# title-owned and rebuilt from the catalog when the page opens, so future
	# works never exist here as disabled spoilers.
	type kehillah_library_acquire_row = button_standard_list {
		size = { 482 42 }
		onclick = "[GetVariableSystem.Clear( 'kehillah_lib_parent_corpus' )]"
		onclick = "[GetScriptedGui( 'kehillah_lib_cache_authors' ).Execute( GuiScope.SetRoot( GetPlayer.MakeScope ).End )]"
		onclick = "[GetVariableSystem.Set( 'kehillah_lib_selected_work', Scope.GetFlagName )]"
		onclick = "[GetScriptedGui( Concatenate( 'kehillah_lib_holders_', Scope.GetFlagName ) ).Execute( GuiScope.SetRoot( GetPlayer.MakeScope ).End )]"
		tooltipwidget = { kehillah_library_work_tooltip = {} }
		icon = {
			parentanchor = left|vcenter
			position = { 4 0 }
			size = { 36 36 }
			texture = "gfx/interface/icons/kehillah_library/kehillah_sefer_rank_frames.dds"
			framesize = { 64 64 }
			frame = "[FixedPointToInt( GetPlayer.MakeScope.ScriptValue( Concatenate( 'kehillah_lib_frame_', Scope.GetFlagName ) ) )]"
			alwaystransparent = yes
		}
		icon = {
			parentanchor = left|vcenter
			position = { 10 0 }
			size = { 24 24 }
			texture = "gfx/interface/icons/artifact/artifact_chronicle.dds"
			alwaystransparent = yes
		}
		text_single = {
			parentanchor = left|vcenter
			position = { 50 0 }
			text = "[Localize( Concatenate( 'kehillah_lib_name_', Scope.GetFlagName ) )]"
			default_format = "#high"
			max_width = 215
		}
		text_single = {
			parentanchor = left|vcenter
			position = { 270 0 }
			text = "[Localize( Concatenate( 'KEHILLAH_STANDING_', IntToString( FixedPointToInt( GetPlayer.MakeScope.ScriptValue( Concatenate( 'kehillah_lib_standing_', Scope.GetFlagName ) ) ) ) ) )]"
			default_format = "#weak"
			max_width = 190
		}
	}
	# One collapsible genre box on the Books page (2026-10-15). Open by default
	# (vanilla's foldout idiom, window_domicile.gui overview groups). The shelf
	# rows are driven by the catalog script values in common/script_values/
	# kehillah_library_catalog_values.txt: each work's genre, rank frame and
	# corpus are looked up by its flag, so no per-work GUI exists.
	# Instances override "group_title", "group_extra" (cards shown above the
	# rows), "group_rows" (five rank passes of work rows) and "group_empty".
	type kehillah_library_genre_group = vbox {
		layoutpolicy_horizontal = expanding
		spacing = 2
		ignoreinvisible = yes

		oncreate = "[BindFoldOutContext]"
		oncreate = "[PdxGuiFoldOut.Unfold]"

		button_tertiary = {
			layoutpolicy_horizontal = expanding
			min_height = 34
			onclick = "[PdxGuiFoldOut.Toggle]"
			button_expand_fold_out = {
				widgetanchor = left|vcenter
				parentanchor = left|vcenter
				position = { 8 0 }
			}
			text_single = {
				parentanchor = left|vcenter
				position = { 40 0 }
				alwaystransparent = yes
				default_format = "#high"
				block "group_title" {}
			}
		}

		vbox = {
			visible = "[PdxGuiFoldOut.IsUnfolded]"
			layoutpolicy_horizontal = expanding
			spacing = 2
			ignoreinvisible = yes

			block "group_extra" {}

			block "group_rows" {}
			block "group_empty" {}
		}
	}

	# 2026-11-08: one book spine on the shelf. The block sets its width (by
	# binding tier) and the strip it draws from; the frame picks the colour.
	# Hovering lifts the book; a green ribbon marks a work you have mastered.
	type kehillah_lib_spine = button {
		block "spine_size" {}
		onclick = "[GetVariableSystem.Clear( 'kehillah_lib_parent_corpus' )]"
		onclick = "[GetScriptedGui( 'kehillah_lib_cache_authors' ).Execute( GuiScope.SetRoot( GetPlayer.MakeScope ).End )]"
		onclick = "[GetVariableSystem.Set( 'kehillah_lib_selected_work', Scope.GetFlagName )]"
		onclick = "[GetScriptedGui( Concatenate( 'kehillah_lib_holders_', Scope.GetFlagName ) ).Execute( GuiScope.SetRoot( GetPlayer.MakeScope ).End )]"
		tooltipwidget = { kehillah_library_work_tooltip = {} }
		state = { name = _mouse_hierarchy_enter on_start = "[PdxGuiWidget.FindChild( 'kehillah_spine_art' ).TriggerAnimation( 'kehillah_spine_lift' )]" }
		state = { name = _mouse_hierarchy_leave on_start = "[PdxGuiWidget.FindChild( 'kehillah_spine_art' ).TriggerAnimation( 'kehillah_spine_drop' )]" }
		icon = {
			name = "kehillah_spine_art"
			position = { 0 6 }
			block "spine_art" {}
			frame = "[FixedPointToInt( GetPlayer.MakeScope.ScriptValue( Concatenate( 'kehillah_lib_spine_frame_', Scope.GetFlagName ) ) )]"
			alwaystransparent = yes
			state = { name = kehillah_spine_lift position = { 0 0 } duration = 0.08 using = Animation_Curve_Default }
			state = { name = kehillah_spine_drop position = { 0 6 } duration = 0.08 using = Animation_Curve_Default }
			icon = {
				visible = "[GetScriptedGui( Concatenate( 'kehillah_lib_studied_', Scope.GetFlagName ) ).IsValid( GuiScope.SetRoot( GetPlayer.MakeScope ).End )]"
				parentanchor = top|hcenter
				widgetanchor = top|hcenter
				position = { 0 -7 }
				size = { 6 20 }
				texture = "gfx/interface/icons/kehillah_library/kehillah_spine_ribbon.dds"
				alwaystransparent = yes
			}
		}
	}

	# A shelf book: the one spine of its binding tier is shown.
	type kehillah_lib_spine_item = hbox {
		ignoreinvisible = yes
		block "item_visible" {}
		kehillah_lib_spine = {
			blockoverride "spine_size" { size = { 14 86 } visible = "[EqualTo_CFixedPoint( GetPlayer.MakeScope.ScriptValue( Concatenate( 'kehillah_lib_spine_tier_', Scope.GetFlagName ) ), '(CFixedPoint)1' )]" }
			blockoverride "spine_art" { size = { 14 80 } texture = "gfx/interface/icons/kehillah_library/kehillah_spine_t1.dds" framesize = { 14 80 } }
		}
		kehillah_lib_spine = {
			blockoverride "spine_size" { size = { 10 86 } visible = "[EqualTo_CFixedPoint( GetPlayer.MakeScope.ScriptValue( Concatenate( 'kehillah_lib_spine_tier_', Scope.GetFlagName ) ), '(CFixedPoint)2' )]" }
			blockoverride "spine_art" { size = { 10 80 } texture = "gfx/interface/icons/kehillah_library/kehillah_spine_t2.dds" framesize = { 10 80 } }
		}
		kehillah_lib_spine = {
			blockoverride "spine_size" { size = { 14 86 } visible = "[EqualTo_CFixedPoint( GetPlayer.MakeScope.ScriptValue( Concatenate( 'kehillah_lib_spine_tier_', Scope.GetFlagName ) ), '(CFixedPoint)3' )]" }
			blockoverride "spine_art" { size = { 14 80 } texture = "gfx/interface/icons/kehillah_library/kehillah_spine_t3.dds" framesize = { 14 80 } }
		}
		kehillah_lib_spine = {
			blockoverride "spine_size" { size = { 18 86 } visible = "[EqualTo_CFixedPoint( GetPlayer.MakeScope.ScriptValue( Concatenate( 'kehillah_lib_spine_tier_', Scope.GetFlagName ) ), '(CFixedPoint)4' )]" }
			blockoverride "spine_art" { size = { 18 80 } texture = "gfx/interface/icons/kehillah_library/kehillah_spine_t4.dds" framesize = { 18 80 } }
		}
		kehillah_lib_spine = {
			blockoverride "spine_size" { size = { 22 86 } visible = "[EqualTo_CFixedPoint( GetPlayer.MakeScope.ScriptValue( Concatenate( 'kehillah_lib_spine_tier_', Scope.GetFlagName ) ), '(CFixedPoint)5' )]" }
			blockoverride "spine_art" { size = { 22 80 } texture = "gfx/interface/icons/kehillah_library/kehillah_spine_t5.dds" framesize = { 22 80 } }
		}
		kehillah_lib_spine = {
			blockoverride "spine_size" { size = { 26 86 } visible = "[EqualTo_CFixedPoint( GetPlayer.MakeScope.ScriptValue( Concatenate( 'kehillah_lib_spine_tier_', Scope.GetFlagName ) ), '(CFixedPoint)6' )]" }
			blockoverride "spine_art" { size = { 26 80 } texture = "gfx/interface/icons/kehillah_library/kehillah_spine_t6.dds" framesize = { 26 80 } }
		}
		kehillah_lib_spine = {
			blockoverride "spine_size" { size = { 30 86 } visible = "[EqualTo_CFixedPoint( GetPlayer.MakeScope.ScriptValue( Concatenate( 'kehillah_lib_spine_tier_', Scope.GetFlagName ) ), '(CFixedPoint)7' )]" }
			blockoverride "spine_art" { size = { 30 80 } texture = "gfx/interface/icons/kehillah_library/kehillah_spine_t7.dds" framesize = { 30 80 } }
		}
	}

	# The same binding, small and not clickable, for the Sefarim ledger's rows.
	type kehillah_lib_spine_icon = widget {
		size = { 20 46 }
		icon = {
			visible = "[EqualTo_CFixedPoint( GetPlayer.MakeScope.ScriptValue( Concatenate( 'kehillah_lib_spine_tier_', Scope.GetFlagName ) ), '(CFixedPoint)1' )]"
			parentanchor = vcenter|hcenter
			widgetanchor = vcenter|hcenter
			size = { 8 44 }
			texture = "gfx/interface/icons/kehillah_library/kehillah_spine_t1.dds"
			framesize = { 14 80 }
			frame = "[FixedPointToInt( GetPlayer.MakeScope.ScriptValue( Concatenate( 'kehillah_lib_spine_frame_', Scope.GetFlagName ) ) )]"
			alwaystransparent = yes
		}
		icon = {
			visible = "[EqualTo_CFixedPoint( GetPlayer.MakeScope.ScriptValue( Concatenate( 'kehillah_lib_spine_tier_', Scope.GetFlagName ) ), '(CFixedPoint)2' )]"
			parentanchor = vcenter|hcenter
			widgetanchor = vcenter|hcenter
			size = { 6 44 }
			texture = "gfx/interface/icons/kehillah_library/kehillah_spine_t2.dds"
			framesize = { 10 80 }
			frame = "[FixedPointToInt( GetPlayer.MakeScope.ScriptValue( Concatenate( 'kehillah_lib_spine_frame_', Scope.GetFlagName ) ) )]"
			alwaystransparent = yes
		}
		icon = {
			visible = "[EqualTo_CFixedPoint( GetPlayer.MakeScope.ScriptValue( Concatenate( 'kehillah_lib_spine_tier_', Scope.GetFlagName ) ), '(CFixedPoint)3' )]"
			parentanchor = vcenter|hcenter
			widgetanchor = vcenter|hcenter
			size = { 8 44 }
			texture = "gfx/interface/icons/kehillah_library/kehillah_spine_t3.dds"
			framesize = { 14 80 }
			frame = "[FixedPointToInt( GetPlayer.MakeScope.ScriptValue( Concatenate( 'kehillah_lib_spine_frame_', Scope.GetFlagName ) ) )]"
			alwaystransparent = yes
		}
		icon = {
			visible = "[EqualTo_CFixedPoint( GetPlayer.MakeScope.ScriptValue( Concatenate( 'kehillah_lib_spine_tier_', Scope.GetFlagName ) ), '(CFixedPoint)4' )]"
			parentanchor = vcenter|hcenter
			widgetanchor = vcenter|hcenter
			size = { 10 44 }
			texture = "gfx/interface/icons/kehillah_library/kehillah_spine_t4.dds"
			framesize = { 18 80 }
			frame = "[FixedPointToInt( GetPlayer.MakeScope.ScriptValue( Concatenate( 'kehillah_lib_spine_frame_', Scope.GetFlagName ) ) )]"
			alwaystransparent = yes
		}
		icon = {
			visible = "[EqualTo_CFixedPoint( GetPlayer.MakeScope.ScriptValue( Concatenate( 'kehillah_lib_spine_tier_', Scope.GetFlagName ) ), '(CFixedPoint)5' )]"
			parentanchor = vcenter|hcenter
			widgetanchor = vcenter|hcenter
			size = { 12 44 }
			texture = "gfx/interface/icons/kehillah_library/kehillah_spine_t5.dds"
			framesize = { 22 80 }
			frame = "[FixedPointToInt( GetPlayer.MakeScope.ScriptValue( Concatenate( 'kehillah_lib_spine_frame_', Scope.GetFlagName ) ) )]"
			alwaystransparent = yes
		}
		icon = {
			visible = "[EqualTo_CFixedPoint( GetPlayer.MakeScope.ScriptValue( Concatenate( 'kehillah_lib_spine_tier_', Scope.GetFlagName ) ), '(CFixedPoint)6' )]"
			parentanchor = vcenter|hcenter
			widgetanchor = vcenter|hcenter
			size = { 14 44 }
			texture = "gfx/interface/icons/kehillah_library/kehillah_spine_t6.dds"
			framesize = { 26 80 }
			frame = "[FixedPointToInt( GetPlayer.MakeScope.ScriptValue( Concatenate( 'kehillah_lib_spine_frame_', Scope.GetFlagName ) ) )]"
			alwaystransparent = yes
		}
		icon = {
			visible = "[EqualTo_CFixedPoint( GetPlayer.MakeScope.ScriptValue( Concatenate( 'kehillah_lib_spine_tier_', Scope.GetFlagName ) ), '(CFixedPoint)7' )]"
			parentanchor = vcenter|hcenter
			widgetanchor = vcenter|hcenter
			size = { 16 44 }
			texture = "gfx/interface/icons/kehillah_library/kehillah_spine_t7.dds"
			framesize = { 30 80 }
			frame = "[FixedPointToInt( GetPlayer.MakeScope.ScriptValue( Concatenate( 'kehillah_lib_spine_frame_', Scope.GetFlagName ) ) )]"
			alwaystransparent = yes
		}
	}

	# One community's library. Datacontexts are set by the instance:
	# Character = the community's leader, Title = their primary title.
	type kehillah_library_body = vbox {
		layoutpolicy_horizontal = expanding
		layoutpolicy_vertical = expanding
		spacing = 4
		ignoreinvisible = yes

		# Keep the collection and the yeshiva controls on separate pages.
		hbox = {
			layoutpolicy_horizontal = expanding
			spacing = 4
			button_standard_list = {
				size = { 246 25 }
				text = "KEHILLAH_LIB_TAB_COLLECTION"
				down = "[Or( Not( GetVariableSystem.Exists( 'kehillah_lib_show_yeshiva' ) ), Not( GreaterThan_CFixedPoint( Character.MakeScope.ScriptValue( 'kehillah_has_yeshiva_value' ), '(CFixedPoint)0' ) ) )]"
				onclick = "[GetVariableSystem.Clear( 'kehillah_lib_show_yeshiva' )]"
				onclick = "[GetScriptedGui( 'kehillah_lib_shelf_layout' ).Execute( GuiScope.SetRoot( GetPlayer.MakeScope ).AddScope( 'library', Title.MakeScope ).End )]"
			}
			button_standard_list = {
				visible = "[GreaterThan_CFixedPoint( Character.MakeScope.ScriptValue( 'kehillah_has_yeshiva_value' ), '(CFixedPoint)0' )]"
				size = { 246 25 }
				text = "KEHILLAH_LIB_TAB_YESHIVA"
				down = "[GetVariableSystem.Exists( 'kehillah_lib_show_yeshiva' )]"
				onclick = "[GetVariableSystem.Set( 'kehillah_lib_show_yeshiva', 'yes' )]"
			}
		}

		### (The header lives in each window, not here: only the
		### standalone window has a close button that does anything.)

		### THE YESHIVA (V29 sections 9-10, 2026-10-11). Shown first, only
		### for a community that has one: renown tier, who heads it, what it
		### teaches, and its students. All text -- script values and custom loc on
		### the same Character datacontext the library uses.
		vbox = {
			visible = "[And( GetVariableSystem.Exists( 'kehillah_lib_show_yeshiva' ), GreaterThan_CFixedPoint( Character.MakeScope.ScriptValue( 'kehillah_has_yeshiva_value' ), '(CFixedPoint)0' ) )]"
			layoutpolicy_horizontal = expanding
			layoutpolicy_vertical = expanding
			spacing = 2
			ignoreinvisible = yes

			### Breathing room under the tabs, then a title block: name and
			### renown first, who/how many second, the Greatness note last.
			widget = { size = { 4 14 } }
			text_single = {
				text = "KEHILLAH_YESHIVA_TITLE"
				default_format = "#T"
			}
			### Renown carries the Greatness note as a hover, not a line of
			### its own; the student count lives in the Students heading.
			text_single = {
				text = "KEHILLAH_YESHIVA_RENOWN_LINE"
				tooltip = "KEHILLAH_YESHIVA_GREATNESS_NOTE"
			}
			text_single = {
				text = "KEHILLAH_YESHIVA_HEAD_LINE"
			}
			widget = { size = { 4 8 } }
			divider_light = {
				layoutpolicy_horizontal = expanding
			}
			### What it teaches. Another community's: a line of text. Your
			### own: vanilla's filter-row buttons (button_standard_list,
			### jomini_achievements_window.gui), clickable when the head can
			### teach that subject (V29 section 11.3). The current focus is
			### disabled, and a disabled button never shows `down` (live
			### 2026-10-12: all three looked alike), so each button's TEXT
			### carries its state -- bright for the current focus, plain for
			### one you can switch to, grey for one you cannot -- and its
			### tooltip opens with a status line.
			text_single = {
				visible = "[Not( Character.IsLocalPlayer )]"
				text = "KEHILLAH_YESHIVA_PANEL_FOCUS"
			}
			text_single = {
				visible = "[Character.IsLocalPlayer]"
				default_format = "#high"
				text = "KEHILLAH_YESHIVA_FOCUS_LABEL"
			}
			hbox = {
				visible = "[Character.IsLocalPlayer]"
				layoutpolicy_horizontal = expanding
				spacing = 4

				button_standard_list = {
					size = { 160 28 }
					text = "[Select_CString( GetScriptedGui( 'kehillah_yeshiva_focus_is_talmudics' ).IsValid( GuiScope.SetRoot( GetPlayer.MakeScope ).End ), Localize( 'KEHILLAH_YESHIVA_FOCUS_TALMUDICS_ON' ), Select_CString( GetScriptedGui( 'kehillah_yeshiva_focus_talmudics' ).IsValid( GuiScope.SetRoot( GetPlayer.MakeScope ).End ), Localize( 'KEHILLAH_YESHIVA_FOCUS_TALMUDICS' ), Localize( 'KEHILLAH_YESHIVA_FOCUS_TALMUDICS_OFF' ) ) )]"
					tooltip = "[Concatenate( Select_CString( GetScriptedGui( 'kehillah_yeshiva_focus_is_talmudics' ).IsValid( GuiScope.SetRoot( GetPlayer.MakeScope ).End ), Localize( 'KEHILLAH_YESHIVA_FOCUS_STATUS_ON' ), Select_CString( GetScriptedGui( 'kehillah_yeshiva_focus_talmudics' ).IsValid( GuiScope.SetRoot( GetPlayer.MakeScope ).End ), Localize( 'KEHILLAH_YESHIVA_FOCUS_STATUS_CAN' ), Localize( 'KEHILLAH_YESHIVA_FOCUS_STATUS_CANNOT' ) ) ), Localize( 'KEHILLAH_YESHIVA_FOCUS_TALMUDICS_TT' ) )]"
					down = "[GetScriptedGui( 'kehillah_yeshiva_focus_is_talmudics' ).IsValid( GuiScope.SetRoot( GetPlayer.MakeScope ).End )]"
					enabled = "[GetScriptedGui( 'kehillah_yeshiva_focus_talmudics' ).IsValid( GuiScope.SetRoot( GetPlayer.MakeScope ).End )]"
					onclick = "[GetScriptedGui( 'kehillah_yeshiva_focus_talmudics' ).Execute( GuiScope.SetRoot( GetPlayer.MakeScope ).End )]"
				}
				button_standard_list = {
					size = { 160 28 }
					text = "[Select_CString( GetScriptedGui( 'kehillah_yeshiva_focus_is_parshanut' ).IsValid( GuiScope.SetRoot( GetPlayer.MakeScope ).End ), Localize( 'KEHILLAH_YESHIVA_FOCUS_PARSHANUT_ON' ), Select_CString( GetScriptedGui( 'kehillah_yeshiva_focus_parshanut' ).IsValid( GuiScope.SetRoot( GetPlayer.MakeScope ).End ), Localize( 'KEHILLAH_YESHIVA_FOCUS_PARSHANUT' ), Localize( 'KEHILLAH_YESHIVA_FOCUS_PARSHANUT_OFF' ) ) )]"
					tooltip = "[Concatenate( Select_CString( GetScriptedGui( 'kehillah_yeshiva_focus_is_parshanut' ).IsValid( GuiScope.SetRoot( GetPlayer.MakeScope ).End ), Localize( 'KEHILLAH_YESHIVA_FOCUS_STATUS_ON' ), Select_CString( GetScriptedGui( 'kehillah_yeshiva_focus_parshanut' ).IsValid( GuiScope.SetRoot( GetPlayer.MakeScope ).End ), Localize( 'KEHILLAH_YESHIVA_FOCUS_STATUS_CAN' ), Localize( 'KEHILLAH_YESHIVA_FOCUS_STATUS_CANNOT' ) ) ), Localize( 'KEHILLAH_YESHIVA_FOCUS_PARSHANUT_TT' ) )]"
					down = "[GetScriptedGui( 'kehillah_yeshiva_focus_is_parshanut' ).IsValid( GuiScope.SetRoot( GetPlayer.MakeScope ).End )]"
					enabled = "[GetScriptedGui( 'kehillah_yeshiva_focus_parshanut' ).IsValid( GuiScope.SetRoot( GetPlayer.MakeScope ).End )]"
					onclick = "[GetScriptedGui( 'kehillah_yeshiva_focus_parshanut' ).Execute( GuiScope.SetRoot( GetPlayer.MakeScope ).End )]"
				}
				button_standard_list = {
					size = { 160 28 }
					text = "[Select_CString( GetScriptedGui( 'kehillah_yeshiva_focus_is_hashkafa' ).IsValid( GuiScope.SetRoot( GetPlayer.MakeScope ).End ), Localize( 'KEHILLAH_YESHIVA_FOCUS_HASHKAFA_ON' ), Select_CString( GetScriptedGui( 'kehillah_yeshiva_focus_hashkafa' ).IsValid( GuiScope.SetRoot( GetPlayer.MakeScope ).End ), Localize( 'KEHILLAH_YESHIVA_FOCUS_HASHKAFA' ), Localize( 'KEHILLAH_YESHIVA_FOCUS_HASHKAFA_OFF' ) ) )]"
					tooltip = "[Concatenate( Select_CString( GetScriptedGui( 'kehillah_yeshiva_focus_is_hashkafa' ).IsValid( GuiScope.SetRoot( GetPlayer.MakeScope ).End ), Localize( 'KEHILLAH_YESHIVA_FOCUS_STATUS_ON' ), Select_CString( GetScriptedGui( 'kehillah_yeshiva_focus_hashkafa' ).IsValid( GuiScope.SetRoot( GetPlayer.MakeScope ).End ), Localize( 'KEHILLAH_YESHIVA_FOCUS_STATUS_CAN' ), Localize( 'KEHILLAH_YESHIVA_FOCUS_STATUS_CANNOT' ) ) ), Localize( 'KEHILLAH_YESHIVA_FOCUS_HASHKAFA_TT' ) )]"
					down = "[GetScriptedGui( 'kehillah_yeshiva_focus_is_hashkafa' ).IsValid( GuiScope.SetRoot( GetPlayer.MakeScope ).End )]"
					enabled = "[GetScriptedGui( 'kehillah_yeshiva_focus_hashkafa' ).IsValid( GuiScope.SetRoot( GetPlayer.MakeScope ).End )]"
					onclick = "[GetScriptedGui( 'kehillah_yeshiva_focus_hashkafa' ).Execute( GuiScope.SetRoot( GetPlayer.MakeScope ).End )]"
				}
			}
			### The students (V29 section 10.4), by portrait -- vanilla's own
			### list-of-characters pattern (window_situation_list.gui).
			widget = { size = { 4 8 } }
			divider_light = {
				layoutpolicy_horizontal = expanding
				visible = "[DataModelHasItems( Title.MakeScope.GetList( 'kehillah_yeshiva_students' ) )]"
			}
			text_single = {
				visible = "[DataModelHasItems( Title.MakeScope.GetList( 'kehillah_yeshiva_students' ) )]"
				text = "KEHILLAH_YESHIVA_STUDENTS_HEADING"
				default_format = "#high"
			}
			fixedgridbox = {
				visible = "[DataModelHasItems( Title.MakeScope.GetList( 'kehillah_yeshiva_students' ) )]"
				datamodel = "[Title.MakeScope.GetList( 'kehillah_yeshiva_students' )]"
				# Rows of 4 across the 272px panel, as vanilla's own portrait
				# grids (coronation_supporter_detractor_widget.gui): flipdirection
				# fills rows first; without it the grid fills columns and
				# overflows the panel (live test 2026-10-11).
				addcolumn = 68
				addrow = 96
				flipdirection = yes
				datamodel_wrap = 4

				item = {
					portrait_head_small = {
						datacontext = "[Scope.Char]"
					}
				}
			}
			divider_light = {
				layoutpolicy_horizontal = expanding
			}
			expand = {}
		}

		### No Beit Midrash: nowhere to keep a book.
		text_multi = {
			visible = "[Not( GreaterThan_CFixedPoint( Character.MakeScope.ScriptValue( 'kehillah_has_beit_midrash_value' ), '(CFixedPoint)0' ) )]"
			layoutpolicy_horizontal = expanding
			autoresize = yes
			text = "KEHILLAH_LIB_NO_BEIT_MIDRASH"
			default_format = "#weak;italic"
			max_width = @lib_width
		}

		### The library.
		vbox = {
			visible = "[And( Or( Not( GetVariableSystem.Exists( 'kehillah_lib_show_yeshiva' ) ), Not( GreaterThan_CFixedPoint( Character.MakeScope.ScriptValue( 'kehillah_has_yeshiva_value' ), '(CFixedPoint)0' ) ) ), GreaterThan_CFixedPoint( Character.MakeScope.ScriptValue( 'kehillah_has_beit_midrash_value' ), '(CFixedPoint)0' ) )]"
			layoutpolicy_horizontal = expanding
			spacing = 4
			ignoreinvisible = yes

			# 2026-11-08: THE SHELF (docs/implementation/2026-11-08-library-shelf-and-ledger.md).
			# Three genre tabs. Each opens on its foundational centrepiece -- the Torah in
			# the ark with the Prophets and the Writings, the Shas case, or a reading stand
			# with the library's most esteemed work -- above shelves of books whose width
			# and binding follow their standing in the viewer's rite. The shelves are laid
			# out in script (kehillah_lib_shelf_layout_effect), run as the page shows and
			# when a tab is chosen. This replaced the genre boxes, the corpus cards, the
			# Acquire page and the All works page; the Sefarim ledger window is the catalog.
			vbox = {
				visible = "[Not( GetVariableSystem.Exists( 'kehillah_lib_selected_work' ) )]"
				layoutpolicy_horizontal = expanding
				spacing = 4
				ignoreinvisible = yes
				state = {
					name = _show
					on_start = "[GetScriptedGui( 'kehillah_lib_shelf_layout' ).Execute( GuiScope.SetRoot( GetPlayer.MakeScope ).AddScope( 'library', Title.MakeScope ).End )]"
				}

				text_single = {
					visible = "[DataModelHasItems( Title.MakeScope.GetList( 'kehillah_library_works' ) )]"
					text = "KEHILLAH_LIB_SUBHEADER"
					default_format = "#weak;italic"
					max_width = @lib_width
				}
				text_multi = {
					visible = "[Not( DataModelHasItems( Title.MakeScope.GetList( 'kehillah_library_works' ) ) )]"
					layoutpolicy_horizontal = expanding
					autoresize = yes
					text = "KEHILLAH_LIB_EMPTY"
					default_format = "#weak;italic"
					max_width = @lib_width
				}

				### The genre tabs.
				hbox = {
					layoutpolicy_horizontal = expanding
					spacing = 4
					button_standard_list = {
						size = { 158 28 }
						text = "KEHILLAH_LIB_GROUP_PARSHANUT"
						down = "[Or( EqualTo_string( GetVariableSystem.Get( 'kehillah_lib_genre_tab' ), '1' ), Not( GetVariableSystem.Exists( 'kehillah_lib_genre_tab' ) ) )]"
						onclick = "[GetVariableSystem.Set( 'kehillah_lib_genre_tab', '1' )]"
						onclick = "[GetScriptedGui( 'kehillah_lib_shelf_layout' ).Execute( GuiScope.SetRoot( GetPlayer.MakeScope ).AddScope( 'library', Title.MakeScope ).End )]"
					}
					button_standard_list = {
						size = { 158 28 }
						text = "KEHILLAH_LIB_GROUP_TALMUDICS"
						down = "[EqualTo_string( GetVariableSystem.Get( 'kehillah_lib_genre_tab' ), '2' )]"
						onclick = "[GetVariableSystem.Set( 'kehillah_lib_genre_tab', '2' )]"
						onclick = "[GetScriptedGui( 'kehillah_lib_shelf_layout' ).Execute( GuiScope.SetRoot( GetPlayer.MakeScope ).AddScope( 'library', Title.MakeScope ).End )]"
					}
					button_standard_list = {
						size = { 158 28 }
						text = "KEHILLAH_LIB_GROUP_HASHKAFA"
						down = "[EqualTo_string( GetVariableSystem.Get( 'kehillah_lib_genre_tab' ), '3' )]"
						onclick = "[GetVariableSystem.Set( 'kehillah_lib_genre_tab', '3' )]"
						onclick = "[GetScriptedGui( 'kehillah_lib_shelf_layout' ).Execute( GuiScope.SetRoot( GetPlayer.MakeScope ).AddScope( 'library', Title.MakeScope ).End )]"
					}
				}

				### A foundation incomplete: the Tanakh for every Jewish library, the Bavli
				### where the viewer's rite holds it canonical.
				text_single = {
					visible = "[LessThan_CFixedPoint( Title.MakeScope.ScriptValue( 'kehillah_lib_tanakh_held_count_value' ), '(CFixedPoint)3' )]"
					text = "KEHILLAH_SHELF_MISSING_TANAKH"
					tooltip = "KEHILLAH_SHELF_MISSING_TT"
					max_width = @lib_width
				}
				text_single = {
					visible = "[And( GreaterThan_CFixedPoint( GetPlayer.MakeScope.ScriptValue( 'kehillah_lib_standing_work_bavli_moed' ), '(CFixedPoint)10' ), LessThan_CFixedPoint( Title.MakeScope.ScriptValue( 'kehillah_lib_bavli_held_count_value' ), '(CFixedPoint)6' ) )]"
					text = "KEHILLAH_SHELF_MISSING_BAVLI"
					tooltip = "KEHILLAH_SHELF_MISSING_TT"
					max_width = @lib_width
				}

				scrollbox = {
					layoutpolicy_horizontal = expanding
					size = { @lib_width @lib_list_height }
					blockoverride "scrollbox_margins" { margin = { 0 4 } margin_right = 12 }
					blockoverride "scrollbox_content" {
						vbox = {
							layoutpolicy_horizontal = expanding
							spacing = 0
							ignoreinvisible = yes

							### Parshanut: the Torah in the ark, the Prophets and the Writings beside it.
							widget = {
								visible = "[Or( EqualTo_string( GetVariableSystem.Get( 'kehillah_lib_genre_tab' ), '1' ), Not( GetVariableSystem.Exists( 'kehillah_lib_genre_tab' ) ) )]"
								size = { 482 170 }
								button = {
									parentanchor = bottom|hcenter
									widgetanchor = bottom|hcenter
									position = { -84 -12 }
									size = { 34 118 }
									tooltip = "kehillah_lib_tt_work_tanakh_neviim"
									using = tooltip_se
									onclick = "[GetVariableSystem.Clear( 'kehillah_lib_parent_corpus' )]"
									onclick = "[GetScriptedGui( 'kehillah_lib_cache_authors' ).Execute( GuiScope.SetRoot( GetPlayer.MakeScope ).End )]"
									onclick = "[GetVariableSystem.Set( 'kehillah_lib_selected_work', 'work_tanakh_neviim' )]"
									onclick = "[GetScriptedGui( Concatenate( 'kehillah_lib_holders_', 'work_tanakh_neviim' ) ).Execute( GuiScope.SetRoot( GetPlayer.MakeScope ).End )]"
									state = { name = _mouse_hierarchy_enter on_start = "[PdxGuiWidget.FindChild( 'kehillah_spine_art' ).TriggerAnimation( 'kehillah_spine_lift' )]" }
									state = { name = _mouse_hierarchy_leave on_start = "[PdxGuiWidget.FindChild( 'kehillah_spine_art' ).TriggerAnimation( 'kehillah_spine_drop' )]" }
									icon = {
										name = "kehillah_spine_art"
										position = { 0 6 }
										size = { 34 112 }
										texture = "gfx/interface/icons/kehillah_library/kehillah_lib_codex.dds"
										framesize = { 34 112 }
										frame = "[Select_int32( GreaterThan_CFixedPoint( Title.MakeScope.ScriptValue( 'kehillah_lib_held_work_tanakh_neviim' ), '(CFixedPoint)0' ), '(int32)1', '(int32)3' )]"
										alwaystransparent = yes
										state = { name = kehillah_spine_lift position = { 0 0 } duration = 0.08 using = Animation_Curve_Default }
										state = { name = kehillah_spine_drop position = { 0 6 } duration = 0.08 using = Animation_Curve_Default }
										icon = {
											visible = "[GetScriptedGui( 'kehillah_lib_studied_work_tanakh_neviim' ).IsValid( GuiScope.SetRoot( GetPlayer.MakeScope ).End )]"
											parentanchor = top|hcenter
											widgetanchor = top|hcenter
											position = { 0 -7 }
											size = { 6 20 }
											texture = "gfx/interface/icons/kehillah_library/kehillah_spine_ribbon.dds"
											alwaystransparent = yes
										}
									}
								}
								button = {
									parentanchor = bottom|hcenter
									widgetanchor = bottom|hcenter
									position = { 0 -12 }
									size = { 120 156 }
									tooltip = "kehillah_lib_tt_work_tanakh_torah"
									using = tooltip_se
									onclick = "[GetVariableSystem.Clear( 'kehillah_lib_parent_corpus' )]"
									onclick = "[GetScriptedGui( 'kehillah_lib_cache_authors' ).Execute( GuiScope.SetRoot( GetPlayer.MakeScope ).End )]"
									onclick = "[GetVariableSystem.Set( 'kehillah_lib_selected_work', 'work_tanakh_torah' )]"
									onclick = "[GetScriptedGui( Concatenate( 'kehillah_lib_holders_', 'work_tanakh_torah' ) ).Execute( GuiScope.SetRoot( GetPlayer.MakeScope ).End )]"
									state = { name = _mouse_hierarchy_enter on_start = "[PdxGuiWidget.FindChild( 'kehillah_spine_art' ).TriggerAnimation( 'kehillah_spine_lift' )]" }
									state = { name = _mouse_hierarchy_leave on_start = "[PdxGuiWidget.FindChild( 'kehillah_spine_art' ).TriggerAnimation( 'kehillah_spine_drop' )]" }
									icon = {
										name = "kehillah_spine_art"
										position = { 0 6 }
										size = { 120 150 }
										texture = "gfx/interface/icons/kehillah_library/kehillah_lib_ark.dds"
										framesize = { 120 150 }
										frame = "[Select_int32( GreaterThan_CFixedPoint( Title.MakeScope.ScriptValue( 'kehillah_lib_held_work_tanakh_torah' ), '(CFixedPoint)0' ), '(int32)1', '(int32)2' )]"
										alwaystransparent = yes
										state = { name = kehillah_spine_lift position = { 0 0 } duration = 0.08 using = Animation_Curve_Default }
										state = { name = kehillah_spine_drop position = { 0 6 } duration = 0.08 using = Animation_Curve_Default }
										icon = {
											visible = "[GetScriptedGui( 'kehillah_lib_studied_work_tanakh_torah' ).IsValid( GuiScope.SetRoot( GetPlayer.MakeScope ).End )]"
											parentanchor = top|hcenter
											widgetanchor = top|hcenter
											position = { 0 -7 }
											size = { 6 20 }
											texture = "gfx/interface/icons/kehillah_library/kehillah_spine_ribbon.dds"
											alwaystransparent = yes
										}
									}
								}
								button = {
									parentanchor = bottom|hcenter
									widgetanchor = bottom|hcenter
									position = { 84 -12 }
									size = { 34 118 }
									tooltip = "kehillah_lib_tt_work_tanakh_ketuvim"
									using = tooltip_se
									onclick = "[GetVariableSystem.Clear( 'kehillah_lib_parent_corpus' )]"
									onclick = "[GetScriptedGui( 'kehillah_lib_cache_authors' ).Execute( GuiScope.SetRoot( GetPlayer.MakeScope ).End )]"
									onclick = "[GetVariableSystem.Set( 'kehillah_lib_selected_work', 'work_tanakh_ketuvim' )]"
									onclick = "[GetScriptedGui( Concatenate( 'kehillah_lib_holders_', 'work_tanakh_ketuvim' ) ).Execute( GuiScope.SetRoot( GetPlayer.MakeScope ).End )]"
									state = { name = _mouse_hierarchy_enter on_start = "[PdxGuiWidget.FindChild( 'kehillah_spine_art' ).TriggerAnimation( 'kehillah_spine_lift' )]" }
									state = { name = _mouse_hierarchy_leave on_start = "[PdxGuiWidget.FindChild( 'kehillah_spine_art' ).TriggerAnimation( 'kehillah_spine_drop' )]" }
									icon = {
										name = "kehillah_spine_art"
										position = { 0 6 }
										size = { 34 112 }
										texture = "gfx/interface/icons/kehillah_library/kehillah_lib_codex.dds"
										framesize = { 34 112 }
										frame = "[Select_int32( GreaterThan_CFixedPoint( Title.MakeScope.ScriptValue( 'kehillah_lib_held_work_tanakh_ketuvim' ), '(CFixedPoint)0' ), '(int32)2', '(int32)3' )]"
										alwaystransparent = yes
										state = { name = kehillah_spine_lift position = { 0 0 } duration = 0.08 using = Animation_Curve_Default }
										state = { name = kehillah_spine_drop position = { 0 6 } duration = 0.08 using = Animation_Curve_Default }
										icon = {
											visible = "[GetScriptedGui( 'kehillah_lib_studied_work_tanakh_ketuvim' ).IsValid( GuiScope.SetRoot( GetPlayer.MakeScope ).End )]"
											parentanchor = top|hcenter
											widgetanchor = top|hcenter
											position = { 0 -7 }
											size = { 6 20 }
											texture = "gfx/interface/icons/kehillah_library/kehillah_spine_ribbon.dds"
											alwaystransparent = yes
										}
									}
								}
								icon = {
									parentanchor = bottom|hcenter
									widgetanchor = bottom|hcenter
									size = { 470 12 }
									texture = "gfx/interface/icons/kehillah_library/kehillah_lib_case_plank.dds"
									alwaystransparent = yes
								}
							}
							hbox = {
								visible = "[Or( EqualTo_string( GetVariableSystem.Get( 'kehillah_lib_genre_tab' ), '1' ), Not( GetVariableSystem.Exists( 'kehillah_lib_genre_tab' ) ) )]"
								layoutpolicy_horizontal = expanding
								spacing = 8
								margin_top = 2
